    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 real discs to select</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/d115341eb3821759bc6366ece99a4917.poster.avif?t=1740573151\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/d115341eb3821759bc6366ece99a4917.webm?t=1740573151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/d115341eb3821759bc6366ece99a4917.mp4?t=1740573151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 courses to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/a5fcb51cb144c54f7001c3017e5c9b94.poster.avif?t=1740573151\" width=590 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/a5fcb51cb144c54f7001c3017e5c9b94.webm?t=1740573151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/a5fcb51cb144c54f7001c3017e5c9b94.mp4?t=1740573151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with 1-4 players locally with friends or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also training and skills challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with controller or mouse.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 real discs to select</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/d115341eb3821759bc6366ece99a4917.poster.avif?t=1740573151\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/d115341eb3821759bc6366ece99a4917.webm?t=1740573151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/d115341eb3821759bc6366ece99a4917.mp4?t=1740573151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 courses to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/a5fcb51cb144c54f7001c3017e5c9b94.poster.avif?t=1740573151\" width=590 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/a5fcb51cb144c54f7001c3017e5c9b94.webm?t=1740573151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/a5fcb51cb144c54f7001c3017e5c9b94.mp4?t=1740573151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with 1-4 players locally with friends or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also training and skills challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with controller or mouse.</p>",
